'''Moon''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 5th tier in the Main Event during the [[Halloween Event 2021|2021 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
The whole knife is solid black, representing the night sky. On its blade is a bright full moon with stars around it, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

